---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import CrmShowcase from "../components/CrmShowcase.astro";
import WorkflowCanvas from "../components/WorkflowCanvas.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Systems &amp; AI Automation Services" description="A great lead can still be lost when follow-up is slow or information lives in different tools. We build connected CRM pipelines, notifications, nurturing w" path="/crm-automation/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">04 / SYSTEMS &amp; AI AUTOMATION</p><h1>Smarter systems. Built around your business.</h1><p class="lf-lede">A great lead can still be lost when follow-up is slow or information lives in different tools. We connect CRM platforms, lead management, AI agents, follow-up automation and custom software through APIs and integrations so teams can respond consistently and automate routine work.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your goals <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHY IT MATTERS</span><strong>Connected business systems, AI-powered workflows and custom integrations designed around your needs.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE CAPABILITIES</p><h2>Systems we connect and automate.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>CRM setup &amp; pipelines</h3><p>Organize lead stages, ownership, tasks and activity so your team can see what needs attention.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Follow-up automation</h3><p>Configure opt-in-aligned emails, SMS, reminders and internal notifications based on meaningful events.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Custom AI agents &amp; integrations</h3><p>Build purpose-specific AI agents and connected tools using APIs, webhooks and custom development, with defined permissions, escalation paths and human review where needed.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-editorial-section" aria-label="Practical workflows that remove friction."><div class="container"><div class="lf-editorial-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE FOLLOW-THROUGH SYSTEM</p><h2>Practical workflows that remove friction.</h2></div><div class="lf-editorial-grid"><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>01 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Capture and route</h3><p>Bring forms, ads, calls and referral inquiries into an organized pipeline with clear ownership and status definitions.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>02 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Follow-up with safeguards</h3><p>Send relevant acknowledgments and reminders, record replies and stop sequences when prospects opt out or book.</p></article><article class="lf-editorial-tile"><span>03 / FIELD NOTES</span><h3>Custom integrations and AI</h3><p>Connect existing applications through APIs and webhooks; add qualification or assistant workflows where they are useful, controlled and compliant.</p></article></div><p class="lf-editorial-note">You do not have to migrate to GoHighLevel. We can assess your current CRM, spreadsheets, calendar and software before recommending any replacement.</p><div class="lf-editorial-actions"><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/contact/">Discuss your requirements ↗</a><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/our-approach/">See our approach ↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section" aria-labelledby="lf-agent-builder-title"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">CUSTOM AI AGENT DEVELOPMENT</p><h2 id="lf-agent-builder-title">AI agents built for a job, not just a demo.</h2><p>From internal assistants to customer-facing workflows, we scope agents around real tasks, trusted information and the systems your team already uses. These can be voice-based or text-based, depending on the need.</p></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Customer-facing agents</h3><p>Website or messaging assistants that answer approved questions, qualify inquiries and transfer complex requests to your team.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Operations and CRM agents</h3><p>Assist with intake, record updates, lead routing and follow-up preparation across connected tools, with permissions and review checkpoints.</p></article><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Voice and appointment agents</h3><p>Connect AI reception and permission-based follow-up to calendars, CRM records and clear human handoffs.</p></article></div><p class="lf-setting-model-note">Each build is tailored to your data, integrations and risk requirements. Actions, access, testing and human approval are defined before deployment.</p><p><a class="lf-editorial-link" href="/appointment-setting/">Explore AI receptionists and appointment setting ↗</a></p></div></section>
<CrmShowcase />
<WorkflowCanvas />
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Clear steps.<br />Connected execution.</h2><p>The right automation makes human follow-up easier.</p></div><ol class="lf-process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Audit</h3><p>Map where leads arrive and where delays or handoff gaps occur.</p></div></li>
<li><span>02</span><div><h3>Architect</h3><p>Define stages, triggers, permissions and consent requirements.</p></div></li>
<li><span>03</span><div><h3>Implement</h3><p>Configure or code the appropriate CRM and automation workflows.</p></div></li>
<li><span>04</span><div><h3>Validate</h3><p>Test event handling, routing, error cases and reporting.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Questions worth asking.</h2></div><div class="lf-faq-list"><details><summary>Is this limited to GoHighLevel?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. We work with platforms such as HubSpot, GoHighLevel, Salesforce, Pipedrive, n8n, Make and Zapier, as well as custom APIs and software. We recommend the tools that best fit your requirements.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can automation replace our sales team?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Automation can remove repetitive work and improve response times, but human conversations and good sales judgment still matter.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can you connect our existing tools?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Potentially. We first confirm each platform’s supported integrations, API permissions and data requirements.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">CONNECTED SERVICES</p><h2>Better together.</h2></div><div class="lf-related"><a class="lf-related-link" href="/websites-funnels/"><span>Lead Generation Websites &amp; Funnels</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<a class="lf-related-link" href="/appointment-setting/"><span>Appointment Setting Services</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<a class="lf-related-link" href="/performance-marketing/"><span>Performance Marketing Agency</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">LET'S TALK GROWTH</p><h2>Build a more reliable path to your next customer.</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
